# `@abeta.dev/mcp` (`v0.22.0`)

## Zero-Config MCP Registration

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "abeta-react-libs": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@abeta.dev/mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

## Available Tools & Resources

- Tools: `abeta_list_packages`, `abeta_lookup_symbol`, `abeta_check_rsc_boundary`, `abeta_search_rag`, `abeta_traverse_context_graph`.
- Resources: `abeta://llms.txt`, `abeta://registry.json`, `abeta://context-graph.json`, `abeta://rag-chunks.jsonl`.
- Use `--remote` to pull live artifacts from `https://abeta-dev.github.io/react-libs/` instead of the bundled offline snapshot.

Add to your MCP client config (`claude_desktop_config.json`, `.cursor/mcp.json`, or Windsurf):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "abeta-react-libs": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@abeta.dev/mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

- **Offline-first by default:** Ships with the exact version-matched `registry.json`, `context-graph.json`, `rag-chunks.jsonl`, and `llms.txt` bundled in `dist/data/` (`<25ms` startup, zero network required).
- **Live remote mode:** Pass `--remote` (`args: ["-y", "@abeta.dev/mcp", "--remote"]`) to pull the latest published graph directly from `https://abeta-dev.github.io/react-libs/`.

